                <syl /><neume facs="#m-cf85de09-dbf5-4673-a968-207946fd1450" type="podatus" xml:id="m-1f912b60-5808-41ec-89ae-7e11b609bdb2">
                  <nc xml:id="m-bf6fbfc0-5df9-41a6-91b6-e335b17ddf60" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-b7791ded-1310-4c8d-83dd-5edd3df8d5fb" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-8ac486bb-2e70-4fd7-bb6e-5c6ce8195c09">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-b9d2c370-9544-4217-9402-7952d04c4e6c" type="podatus" xml:id="m-1778dda7-2358-4725-9118-adae5601d44a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-034331f4-1c08-4bdc-873d-39160441ff1c" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-8f6359d6-e4bf-412e-8300-b0197897d2c5" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-b0d8cd76-2b36-4a65-be28-f67f62fd4212">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-29842ccd-e488-40a2-a59a-d2ca1a699c0c" type="clivis" xml:id="m-9a72242e-162f-4716-ba02-e178aeb35136">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e8cff0d2-a5f8-4d8f-a990-b464c1080da2" pname="c" oct="4" /><nc xml:id="m-58cca877-fc89-402c-a7c7-4d00e29220cc" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-f59e5ebe-001d-44c7-8d74-9e776085150f">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-ce425dab-f8b5-49ad-9feb-aa55b9baa9f3" type="clivis" xml:id="m-214eab36-fa5f-48e2-aa30-57ed61fb9cd7">
                  <nc xml:id="m-c53e84bb-14f0-491f-a27c-06ad570d4a69" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-302fd4bd-04a3-463b-aaf4-23b1d03ff9f1" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-fff7ae03-e7f5-465a-8e49-89d996bf235d" facs="#m-48969630-56ad-4566-872c-076b226203b3" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2bae853a-6c46-4e48-9f7e-4bccff4d3c51">
            <lg xml:id="m-c55bf25e-f3a2-470a-a01e-546eb12a9494">
              <l xml:id="m-f5971a97-f871-424f-9565-a1b6f3cc90a9" facs="#m-12710602-a4eb-4187-8664-dd7d693e9196" label="ambiguous">December 8.</l><l xml:id="m-93af2463-2b46-4589-80aa-2a1bab719748" facs="#m-eb68a277-f03a-4fb1-b02f-4a161ef65893" label="ambiguous">1317</l><l xml:id="m-e5f2d63f-4931-46c1-9edf-2205ab483455" facs="#m-abf89a66-1dfc-4845-9c12-ed195cba1b6a" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-320ec423-f1ac-4f46-a204-95c5b213fd2f" facs="#m-17529a9a-e5cc-4e85-adaa-bc34cd248a9e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui per Immaculátam Vir- labe praeservásti, “nos quoque</l><l xml:id="m-7ac4d670-2516-4891-b13b-ae46db34b737" facs="#m-55fb4a81-a650-4a52-beb4-60ecfc4e7e17" label="lyrics-like">U ginis Conceptiónem dignum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e879692-b1a8-4c30-91ae-224e366255cc" facs="#m-72183090-54e5-4d96-80c8-28463f528243" label="lyrics-like">mundos ejus intercessióne ad te</l><l xml:id="m-5ccd87ca-7e17-490e-b2e1-be07b2ac89b5" facs="#m-379a9a23-1e49-4b06-af47-335d1e34d830" label="lyrics-like">lio tuo habitáculum praepãrásti:</l><l xml:id="m-31efae58-05ce-4202-a757-7683a756216a" facs="#m-7dc3f2fa-7f44-437a-a75c-f929f486b906" label="lyrics-like">pervenire concédas. Per eúmdem</l><l xml:id="m-7cbd333d-51bb-4640-95df-36c37c079399" facs="#m-713043be-369d-4c70-90c6-f4459d881fa5" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus; ut qui ex morte ejús¬</l><l xml:id="m-90397a8f-96e2-4585-8c6a-2d70eaeabbc9" facs="#m-a20935ce-3792-42c9-8539-63fb88f9884a" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1cf15058-ce15-407a-8b97-a4450c4b978d" facs="#m-bf3f90aa-2093-4889-a24d-b434a007099c" label="lyrics-like">dem Filii tui praevísa, eam ab omni</l><l xml:id="m-93e0320a-62c8-4b0c-af10-74920c0fa4c7" facs="#m-77878dbb-6ff1-4ad8-97bd-65ca3a33f5ac" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Prov. 8. c.</l><l xml:id="m-93f73ee3-2fef-4a32-8c9a-72341aa3fa60" facs="#m-5ec9c6c6-c5b8-44b8-96be-da604a0bbb93" label="lyrics-like">Ominus possédit me in inítio viá- nébat aquis, ne transirent fines suos;</l><l xml:id="m-16f394a1-dad9-4e41-a0a3-815fcaed667d" facs="#m-336146b2-1fd1-4b79-b856-b90122033cf9" label="lyrics-like">quando appendébat fundaménta</l><l xml:id="m-8667045d-23a0-4841-b9dd-a36264183016" facs="#m-c51ff410-e6dc-4140-9082-bb1a55db4a1c" label="lyrics-like">Drum suárum, ántequam quid¬</l><l xml:id="m-50d747b3-dd62-4e91-946d-60c71b05a539" facs="#m-ada7856a-05e2-40a3-a5a2-5d6eaef33ccc" label="lyrics-like">quam fáceret a princípiõ. Ab aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-41b203d5-8091-40ec-8036-16aa4cf20620" facs="#m-30a7b2f2-b669-4534-8e5d-13e29c9b3b16" label="ambiguous">terrae. Cum eo eram cuncta com¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f484605-5f88-4e31-8ece-42d01a6f5e20" facs="#m-475d46a2-e506-404e-a4de-c1d6664fa0da" label="lyrics-like">no ordináta sum, et ex antíquis,</l><l xml:id="m-aad00e3a-f715-4f72-850f-43d9795df186" facs="#m-9db5c08b-b9b1-4d64-8357-f4ca25075701" label="lyrics-like">pónens: et delectábar per síngulos</l><l xml:id="m-ed60835f-563d-4b78-9cec-b44ca639dd30" facs="#m-ce2129d6-6bd5-462d-865d-d6a2a5cb1b03" label="lyrics-like">ántequam terra fieret. Nondum</l><l xml:id="m-59a871f0-c9b2-4b78-9a18-d00bd5e26c8f" facs="#m-82a34f87-707b-42dd-82d6-1adca2fe0068" label="lyrics-like">dies, ludens coram eo omni tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-de6f095a-2b12-474b-99c9-b21a23e798aa" facs="#m-c4cbd444-1b7e-483a-9935-f580a020c7f5" label="lyrics-like">erant abyssi et ego jam concépta</l><l xml:id="m-981f74e6-bd6c-4e70-a44d-85ad4140da03" facs="#m-ce068481-0b96-4e68-bc6b-58f7754c45c2" label="lyrics-like">pore, ludens in orbe terrárum, et</l><l xml:id="m-f04be5d8-7b4f-4312-be6c-bd41b646a96d" facs="#m-f9d5eb65-2a0f-444a-bc5f-1b2eb2ed7c6d" label="lyrics-like">deliciae meae esse cum filiis hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6819670e-0700-4349-88c4-df866f7e7f6c" facs="#m-d2cfac4d-2918-47a7-8b5c-ee598d5af192" label="lyrics-like">eram: necdum fontes aquárum</l><l xml:id="m-8704d4fe-ad36-4544-b176-674021320069" facs="#m-8b857ba4-cf2f-4a0e-a647-7b21688b470c" label="lyrics-like">erúperant: necdum montes gravi</l><l xml:id="m-342b7f25-c646-4e49-98bf-8388cf01d354" facs="#m-eb38084f-d586-42ce-a187-43dc6b4fc957" label="lyrics-like">num. Nunc ergo filii, audíte me:</l><l xml:id="m-9f4fb787-b71a-4e82-b50d-6c3fb5a326fd" facs="#m-42f8634e-c0cb-4a40-a65c-841924430bc9" label="lyrics-like">Beáti qui custódiunt vias meas.</l><l xml:id="m-6a8d3596-60b6-4456-89f2-d3139a92cd5d" facs="#m-13061ba5-af86-46bf-8c14-cd328e19ba4b" label="lyrics-like">mole constíterant: ante colles ego</l><l xml:id="m-89006173-23b4-4e04-849f-708295c3b994" facs="#m-ca40105b-0e23-4acd-90d5-0d75db2fe803" label="lyrics-like">parturiébar: adhuc terram non fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d46ebca-13dd-482c-a681-e126a5ea7a26" facs="#m-bab334f1-a28a-4b34-937e-ed42b7e20400" label="lyrics-like">Audite disciplínam, et estóte sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7561ab3-8c11-480c-b24e-01503ddba311" facs="#m-77bb2e7e-a0f5-4828-99b2-844b0718806e" label="lyrics-like">piéntes, et nolite abjicere eam. Beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1630fa2-1440-49d5-b876-1bd35cd7e216" facs="#m-6ae5da84-6d08-4f29-a149-3fec595570a9" label="lyrics-like">cerat, et flúmina, et cárdines orbis</l><l xml:id="m-6fc63095-9342-4f5f-befa-4de5f46028c0" facs="#m-41516fc1-425c-4cb2-808b-7bd5004dbd79" label="lyrics-like">tus homo qui audit me, et qui vígi¬</l><l xml:id="m-86877e25-7232-4b98-83d5-b4bf01b8bbb9" facs="#m-487aa074-dad0-4aa9-841e-4bbb0e6ef156" label="lyrics-like">terrae. Quando praeparábat caelos,</l><l xml:id="m-4b7c5209-e1be-44a8-b828-9a53893a30ee" facs="#m-ad29caff-7944-49a4-bf18-f7e2fc53103f" label="lyrics-like">lat ad fores meas quotídie, et obsér¬</l><l xml:id="m-bad86ce3-1c90-4577-b781-b45fd6bbd665" facs="#m-5c187e73-5abb-44bb-8d1f-d29f429ce91a" label="lyrics-like">áderam : quando certa lege et gyro</l><l xml:id="m-5c725cea-7d4c-4fde-a88a-e2a7244e0bfe" facs="#m-d117b7da-b761-4ec9-a40d-8406f49e4029" label="lyrics-like">vat ad postes óstii mei. Qui me</l><l xml:id="m-b67dadda-b449-4673-8127-5ac2c106bc9e" facs="#m-8a6bae6a-a331-4b76-85bf-33427fe49e07" label="lyrics-like">vallábat abyssos: quando aéthera</l><l xml:id="m-6a39a650-227a-4c8b-91d4-e027d0d65142" facs="#m-66185f37-8ef9-4eae-8c27-12fc330a4d62" label="lyrics-like">invénerit, invéniet vitam, et háuriet</l><l xml:id="m-348ebf4d-da52-4550-ba24-6e40f826292e" facs="#m-413694e9-c46d-4555-a0f4-8579a4f7da32" label="lyrics-like">firmábat sursum, et librábat fontes</l><l xml:id="m-1ac879f3-3a82-4189-94ed-1831b74ce1b4" facs="#m-e8e1ab16-934f-4c0a-b874-db08d4ab7170" label="lyrics-like">aquárum: quando circúmdabat salútem a Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-a6b1e865-a01e-4db5-a9a0-66b27e5ae30c" facs="#m-5fd4f124-a6ac-4cb4-95e9-52062839aa96" label="lyrics-like">mari términum suum, et legem po¬</l><l xml:id="m-199bd6aa-5832-4844-bde1-e11fc0f4c9fe" facs="#m-b9886045-51c0-41f9-b637-005a2b872a90" label="ambiguous">Grad. E</l><l xml:id="m-290907c2-0781-40bb-88c9-366282476a7b" facs="#m-021255bb-aed2-4d22-9970-007e03eaf1d7" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-9228a29f-4e36-4171-b977-ad9767b0c84d" facs="#m-0759d19d-91a2-4d42-90f7-c27ac811d8a7" label="lyrics-like">Ene-dí-cta es tu,</l><l xml:id="m-c7486dfb-5535-4097-808c-7eceb27457c0" facs="#m-03872510-22a7-4240-8c67-3120ca7cd690" label="lyrics-like">Virgo Ma-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-29dd4045-137b-4afa-9746-c16800aa284c" facs="#m-42833acd-b6b0-42d9-899d-ec044e4329d9" label="lyrics-like">a Dómino Dé-o excél-so,</l><l xml:id="m-6506ea62-72c6-4a38-8521-d4880032b911" facs="#m-b20e566b-5572-4fe3-aec7-62f2c2f2af78" label="ambiguous">prae</l><l xml:id="m-4076c83c-6b19-4c6d-90ba-c020f4a2807e" facs="#m-f672b6a3-cf0e-4c86-ac67-3af4b17cc3ea" label="lyrics-like">ómni- bus mu-li-é-ri-bus su-per térram.</l><l xml:id="m-904c20ed-3617-4853-9e39-ee903568d733" facs="#m-d62b2813-38ed-4e20-bb04-a931080b75ec" label="lyrics-like">V. Tu gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e1ed2a7-27cb-427e-8c19-683cdbcfd64d" facs="#m-58403c1c-51df-43af-aaee-fcc54456d106" label="lyrics-like">ri-a Je-rú¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7afcb62-7653-4c2e-93ca-a519929d4109" facs="#m-1061b20a-c374-4df6-a9dd-15d3d88dc7db" label="lyrics-like">lem, tu laetí-ti¬a</l><l xml:id="m-426aa8bf-7c06-410c-bb61-e456d7b3a101" facs="#m-d7356a6b-3d0f-421b-b422-144a6350c078" label="ambiguous">Is¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7b6dc82-c476-4d6b-a502-778d3f9c40fb" facs="#m-3c43e030-63f2-4ab0-93cd-f1b0ac4d869e" label="ambiguous">ra-el, tu hono¬</l><l xml:id="m-f01f78d7-78a8-4e57-8909-e55988670596" facs="#m-aecb5d49-1612-4842-8944-f8b44bfe2341" label="ambiguous">sa¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>